# Stock Return Calculator - Environment Variables
# 
# To run this project locally, create a file named `.env.local` in the root directory
# and copy these variables into it. You will need to provide your own API keys.

# 1. Finnhub API Key
# Used for fetching real-time stock quotes and profile data.
# Get a free key at: https://finnhub.io/
FINNHUB_API_KEY=your_finnhub_api_key_here

# 2. FRED (Federal Reserve Economic Data) API Key
# Used for fetching US Treasury yields and TIPS breakeven inflation rates.
# Get a free key at: https://fred.stlouisfed.org/docs/api/api_key.html
FRED_API_KEY=your_fred_api_key_here
